Z||000000||FieroLisa||04-04-2001||07:04 PM||||Hey guys and girls:<P>Today I made all the hotel reservations for the shows I'm going to this year: Dells ( I hope), Michigan, and Nat'ls in VA. If anyone I know is going to one of these shows and wants to share a room, let me know. The rooms are so d@mn expensive, I can't afford to go to all the shows. I believe Chris Moore is probably staying with me at least some of those shows...so if anyone wants to pack in a room, let me know.<P><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
