Z||000007||Chris Schaefer||04-04-2001||10:19 PM||||Lisa,<P>I have reservations at the Host hotel in Williamsburg, VA and they are for the dates of July 31st - August 4th.  The room that I have reserved for my family is a King Nonsmoking.  My cost is $64.00 per night for July 31st - August 2nd and $74.00 per night for August 3rd and 4th.  These rates were worked out with the help of my AAA membership.  Much better than $94.00 per night.<P>Just thought everyone would like to know that rates are negotiable.<P>It is also interesting to read where everyone is going.  My Fiero only show trips start in Old Orchard Beach, ME (June 15, 16)then Williamsburg, VA (July 31 - August 5)and then finally Rutland, MA (September 23).<P>See you all somewhere.<P>Chris Schaefer<BR>FOCONE Membership Director/Editor||||reg||1
